Hi,

good news! We are accepted as mentoring organization!

Now our next step is registering the mentors. For this I ask everyone 
who wants to mentor to speak up here. I will then invite you and you 
will get an e-mail from Google. Please check also your spam folder if 
you do not get it. Then follow the instructions in the e-mail to 
register yourself as a mentor. Some of you will already get their 
invitation in a few minutes as I am already inviting some.

Our project ideas are here:

https://wiki.linuxfoundation.org/gsoc/google-summer-code-2022-openprinting-projects

Find here your project(s) where you want to participate as mentor and 
also add your project ideas.

Let us have a great GSoC!

    Till
